    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu wayulili mwaka wumu; cheliliyi nayuli dehi aIsarela nyaka yiyedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu hakutonda muIsarela antu indi makombakaji asatu. Makombakaji ayedi hiyakushakama naSawulu kuMikimashi kumpidiya kuBeteli, ikombakaji dimu dadiŋi najonatani kuGibeya wamuBenjamini. Antu asheluku hakuyifuntisha kunyikala yawu wejima wawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonatani hakutapa mashidika aFwilistinu ashiluwu kuGeba, aFwilistinu achitiya nikuchitiya. Sawulu hakwimba mpùŋa mwahita ituŋa dejima, nindi, AHeberu atiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela ejima atiyili nawu, Sawulu natapi dehi mashidika awaFwilistinu ashiluwu mwituŋa, nawu, AIsarela ananunki dehi ivumba datama kudi aFwilistinu. Antu apompa nikupompa kuGiligali kwadiŋiyi Sawulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AFwilistinu adipompesha nikudipompesha nawu alwi nawaIsarela, makálu makombakaji makumi asatu, akwatuwalu makombakaji atanunadimu, niantu avula neyi wusekulula wekala kuchi kumu chakaluŋalwiji. Enjili nakutuŋa chilombu kuMikimashi, kumusela waBetaveni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela chamwenuwu chinakali dehi, muloŋa antu hiyakumona ihuŋu, antu hiyakuyana kubatajala nimumayeŋu, nimuyiputa, nimumalola, nimujimpwembu, nimumena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu aHeberu amakwawu azambuka dehi Yodana, aya dehi mwituŋa daGadi naGileyadi. Sawulu saŋa adiyi kwindi muGiligali, antu ejima hiyakumulondela nakuzaala hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wachiŋijililili mafuku atanu nayedi, mwomwamukaniniyi Samweli. Samweli kwinza kuGiligali nehi, antu hiyakumumwaŋala nikumumwaŋala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu hakuchinda antu adiŋiyi nawu, adiŋi kwiji neyi amayala makulakaji atanu nadimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulu namwanindi Jonatani, niantu adiŋuwu nawu hiyakushakama kuGeba wakuBenjamini; hakwila aFwilistinu hiyakushakama muchilombu chawu muMikimashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakupupa nyikala hiyakufuma muchilombu chawaFwilistinu yendu yisatu. Chendu chimu hichikuyamunjila yaya kuOfwara mwituŋa daShuwali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chendu chikwawu hichikuya njila yakuBetihoroni. Chendu chikwawu hichikuya njila yakuŋinza yatala muchinekineki chaZebowimi yaya mwisaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwahita ituŋa dawaIsarela dejima himwadiŋi muchiuku, muloŋa Fwilistinu elili nawu, AHeberu akenza kadichilila mpoku jatubali namayoŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela ejima akunkumukilaŋa kudi aFwilistinu nakulola yikwakwayawu, nimatemwawu, niyizembi yawu, ninyipanŋa yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helachochu, adiŋi nekwaŋa dawu dakuhotola nachu ninyipanŋa, nimatemwa, niyikupu yanyisomu, niyizembi, dakuhotola nachu ninyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi ifuku dakwasa njita hikwamwekeni hela mpoku yakabali hela iyoŋa kumakasa awantu adiŋi naSawulu najonatanuku, yamwekeni chiŋa kudi Sawuluna mwanindi Jonatani hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mashidika awaFwilistinu hiyakufuma mwayishiluwu hiyakuya kuchibukubuku chakuMikimashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
